a and his administration's controversies. The event was seen as a attempt by Trump to regain control of the narrative, but it was also criticized for being a \"bizarre theater\" and a \"reality TV show.\"\n\nKey moments from the press conference include:\n\n* Trump blaming Obama for inheriting a \"mess\"\n* Trump stating that his administration is a \"fine-tuned machine\"\n* Trump denying directing Flynn to discuss sanctions with the Russian ambassador\n* Trump attacking the media, calling them \"fake news\" and accusing them of being dishonest and biased\n* Trump stating that he has nothing to do with Russia and that the allegations are a \"ruse\"\n* Trump addressing the controversy surrounding his travel ban\n*",
